 both  issues one user wrote that the in  memoriam section went by so quickly that  they didn't realize chadwick boseman had  been honored  another tweeted instead of wasting time  with the karaoke thing they could have  made a respectful immemorium with a  decent time speed  elsewhere one user stated those names  went by so fast but did anyone see  jessica walter in the in memoriam  did they just forget her another  expressed their disgust at rivera  not being included saying they are foul  for not putting nia rivera  in the in memoriam one twitter user took  it upon themselves to honor rivera  writing since the academy along with the  grammys decided yet again not to include  nya rivera in the tribute section  of their three hour long show we again  have to do it for them  you're with us forever and your talent  legacy will span  beyond generations check out one of our  newest videos right here  plus even more looper videos about the  oscars are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]
 

